{
  "id": "NUM.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Orubara 27",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahara ba Zelofehadi eya Heferi, Heferi eya Gileadi, Gileadi eya Makiri, Makiri eya Manase, nikwo kugir'oti b'oruganda rwa Manase eya Yozefu. Amabara bakaba nibetwa Mahula, Noa, Hogila, Milika na Tirisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija ahali Musa na Eleazari omukuhani, n'aha bebembezi n'eihanga lyona lya Isiraeli, aha mulyango gw'Eihema ly'Omuterano. Bagamba bati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tataichwe akagwa omw'irungu. Akafa yazira obufu obwe nyabwe. Omu kisimba kya Kora ekyagelekire Omukama hakaba athalimu, kandi tiyasigire bana ba bojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubaki ayebeke omu rugandarwe ngu orwo atasigire mwana wa mwojo? Naichwe mutuhe omugabo omu banyarugandabe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa aletera Omukama ebigambo byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama amuhorora ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bahara ba Zelofehadi bali omu mazima. Obahe omugabo gwa ishebo omu banyaruganda babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara ogambire Abaisiraeli oti, ‘K'omuntu alifa atasigire mwana wa bwojo, obusikabwe mubuhe omuhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'ataina muhara mubuhe abarumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'ataina barumuna, obusikabwe mubuhe baishento. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka baishento bataliho, mubuhe omunyarugandawe amuli haihi abutware. Abaisiraeli bakwate ekiragiro eki n'entwaza egi nk'okwo inye Omukama nakuragira iwe Musa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akagambira Musa ati, “Otembe Eibanga eli elya Abarimu olebe ensi eyo mpaire Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo oramara kugibona, naiwe orafa nk'okwo mukuru wawe Aroni yafire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aha rw'okuba timwahuliire byo nabagambire omw'Irungu lya Zini orwo Abaisiraeli baimukya orugomo, mukabura kuboleka okwo ngira obushobora aha nchuro z'amaizi.” (Ezi nizo nchuro za Meriba omw'Irungu lya Zini). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ashubamu Omukama ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Singa Mukama, Ruhanga w'abantu bona, oteho omuntu ow'okutwara eihanga eli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ow'okubatwara omu ndashana n'okubagarura; embaga yawe egi, waitu Mukama, eleke kushusha entaama ezitaina mushumba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Musa ati, “Okwate Yoshua mutabani wa Nuni, niwe muntu alikushobora, omuteho emikono aha mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwemeleze omu maisho ga Eleazari omukuhani n'embaga yona, omugambe okwo niwe alikukusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhe obushobora nk'obwawe, nirwo eihanga lyona lya Isiraeli lilimuhulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayekwate Eleazari omukuhani, ogwo niwe aramugambiraga ebyo ndikwenda orwo arataga kukoza Urimu. Yoshua n'Abaisiraeli bona, nilyo ihanga lyona, kwaba kugenda anga kugaruka, barataga kuragilirwa Eleazari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akora okwo Omukama yamuhangira; akwata Yoshua amwemeleza omu maisho ga Eleazari omukuhani n'embaga yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutaho emikono aha mutwe, amugamba okwo niwe alikumusikira. Ebyo byona Musa akabikora okwo Omukama yamuragiliire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
